<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60335" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτερ-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεριῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.334
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτέρῐσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.38
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				109
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτέρεα</span>):—poet. Verb, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτερεΐζω, οὔ σε πρὶν
					κτεριῶ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.334
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δὲ κτεριοῦσιν Ἀχαιοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.336
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμ᾽, εἴ κε θάνω, κτεριοῦσί γε δῖοι᾽
					Ἀχαιοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.455
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφῳ κ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					204
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούσδ᾽ εἷς τάφος
			ἐκτέρισε</span> Simon.l.c.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1244
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημοσίᾳ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.1678
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				2119
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. cogn., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοί κέ μιν ὦκα ἐν πυρὶ κήαιεν καὶ
					ἐπὶ κτέρεα κτερίσαιεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.285
			</span></i>.</div>
